@startuml overview
' cumin-works - the states of a requirement issue in the acceptance stage.
' A state is a label on GitHub, written without "cumin/status/". "do /" says who works in the state.
' A transition is written: action [guard] / what cumin does. A gray state belongs to another area.
' Render: run scripts/render-diagrams.sh at the root of the repository.

hide empty description

state "planning, implementing, or awaiting-plan-review" as Before #EEEEEE
Before : (the plan area)

state "accepting" as Accepting
Accepting : do / the Planner checks the requirement on main

state "awaiting-acceptance" as AwaitingAcceptance
AwaitingAcceptance : do / the Assignee accepts or sends back

state "awaiting-plan-review" as PlanReview #EEEEEE
PlanReview : (the plan area)

state "implementing" as Implementing #EEEEEE
Implementing : (the plan area)

state "awaiting-decision" as Decision
Decision : do / the Assignee answers

state "ready" as Ready #EEEEEE
Ready : (the plan area)

Before --> Accepting : request the acceptance check\n[every implementation issue is closed, no check after the last close,\nthe follow-up notes are written,\nbelow the limit of issues in progress]\n/ cumin starts the Planner
Accepting --> AwaitingAcceptance : ask for the acceptance\n[the acceptance check completed,\nevery implementation issue is closed]\n/ cumin notifies
Accepting --> PlanReview : ask for the plan review\n[the acceptance check completed,\nan open implementation issue, each open one has one risk label]\n/ cumin notifies
Accepting --> Accepting : request the acceptance check again\n[the Planner run has ended, no question, first time, and:\nno check comment, or an open implementation issue\nwithout exactly one risk label]\n/ cumin starts the Planner again
Accepting --> Decision : stop the acceptance check\n[the Planner run has ended, and: the Planner asked,\nor the same failure after the retry]\n/ cumin notifies
AwaitingAcceptance --> [*] : the Assignee closes the issue
AwaitingAcceptance --> Implementing : send back\n[the Assignee adds ready to a new implementation issue]
Decision --> Ready : the Assignee answers and adds ready

@enduml
